  {
   "id": "object-factory-371425@2.1",
   "gameId": "object-factory-371425",
   "displayName": "Update 2.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-07T16:26:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new update for Object Factory is coming soon—and it’s already available on the beta branch for testing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 2.1 builds on the foundation of 2.0 and pushes factory optimization even further, introducing parallel production challenges, efficiency tracking, and new ways to boost your score.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here’s a first preview of what’s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Parallel Goals (NEW) –",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Multiple objectives can now run at the same time, forcing you to design factories that handle competing demands simultaneously.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Some example setups include",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "– One throughput-required goal running alongside others",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "– Triple-goal scenarios like",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "→ Two throughput goals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "→ One goal shape objective",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This means you can no longer optimize for a single pipeline—you’ll need balanced, scalable systems that perform under pressure.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Throughput Counter Module (NEW) –",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new module gives you direct insight into your production performance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Displays real-time throughput",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Tracks efficiency of your factory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Helps identify bottlenecks and weak links",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This turns optimization into a measurable system, making it easier (and more satisfying) to refine your layouts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Arcade Mode Score Bonus Update –",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Arcade Mode now rewards high-performance factories even more:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Reach certain score per minute thresholds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Unlock up to x2 Goal Shape bonus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The better your factory performs, the more it scales—encouraging fast, efficient, and highly optimized builds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version 2.1 is focused on pushing players to think bigger",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "not just building working factories, but building systems that perform, scale, and adapt under multiple simultaneous demands.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More details soon. For now—get ready to optimize on multiple fronts at once.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Want early access? Here’s how to join the beta branch",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Open your Steam Library",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Right-click Object Factory → Properties",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Go to the Betas tab",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Select the beta branch from the dropdown",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Let the game update—and you’re ready to play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To play first and give feedback, use the beta branch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy to hear what you think 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
