       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The game has been optimized to deliver a smooth and reliable experience on the Steam Deck, supporting both handheld and docked play.",
